---
// Standalone page rather than the BlogPost layout. That layout stamps a pubDate
// and a hero image on whatever it wraps, which is why this page used to claim it
// was published in August 2021. An About page is not a dated post.
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About — Narayan Lekhi"
			description="A high school student working in sports analytics, bringing basic analytics to his school's basketball team."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					I'm a high school student working in sports analytics. My projects start with
					something I noticed during a game and couldn't find an answer to.
				</p>
				<p>
					Right now I'm bringing basic analytics to my school's basketball team. A coach in
					a timeout has no use for a regression table, so most of the work is translation:
					finding the version of a complicated thing that someone can actually use.
				</p>
				<p>
					I also started a sports analytics club at my school, mostly as an excuse to argue
					about this with people who care as much as I do.
				</p>
				<p>There's a lot I haven't learned yet. That's a lot of why I do this.</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
